Explored vulnerability details, affected assets, and recommended remediation actions.
Nessus Plugins
Gained an understanding of the Nessus plugin architecture.
Learned how plugins identify specific vulnerabilities and configuration issues.
Explored plugin information, CVEs, CVSS scores, and vulnerability references.
Vulnerability Prioritisation
Learned how to prioritise remediation based on risk and business impact.
Understood the importance of validating findings before remediation.
Explored best practices for reducing organisational risk.
Reporting
Learned how to generate professional vulnerability assessment reports.
Explored executive summaries and technical reports.
Understood how effective reporting supports remediation planning and communication with stakeholders.
